# Global loading (`uiAsync`)

- **Overlay:** `MainLayoutComponent` shows the blocking spinner when NgRx `uiAsync.pendingDepth > 0` (driven by `AsyncExecutorService`).
- **Fetches (initial load, tab refresh):** wrap HTTP in `AsyncExecutorService.execute(work, { recordSuccess: false, progressMessage?: string })`. Do not add component-only “Loading…” rows for the same work.
- **Mutations:** same `execute()`; default `recordSuccess: true` unless silent success is required.
- **Optional `loaded` signal** is allowed to gate template content until data exists; it must not duplicate the spinner UX.

See `JobseekerModule/docs/DESIGN-GUIDE.md` §5.1.
